1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
Fact check. Did Hamas behead babies?

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:06,200
Let's look at what we know so far about where this claim came from

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,300
and why some media outlets and the White House have retracted the claim.

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:14,400
On Saturday, October 7, Hamas attacked the kibbutz of Kfar Azzah.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:18,000
Members of the media were granted permission on October 10,

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,900
three days later, by the Israeli army to visit Kfar Azzah

7
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:25,000
and witness the aftermath of the Hamas attack.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,900
During the visit, a reporter from Israeli news outlet I-24 tweeted, saying,

9
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:34,600
Soldiers told me they believe 40 babies, children, were killed.

10
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:39,800
As the day progressed, the information morphed from at least 40 babies were killed

11
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,800
to some were beheaded.

12
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:45,700
On the day, the Israeli army could not confirm beheadings.

13
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:52,400
The very next day, in London, commuters were subjected to this horrifying and unverified headline.

14
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:56,900
On October 11, many Western media outlets jumped on that claim,

15
00:00:56,900 --> 00:01:00,000
quoting the spokesman of Israel's prime minister.

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,600
The Israeli prime minister's spokesman just confirmed babies and toddlers were found

17
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:09,800
with their heads decapitated in Kfar Azzah.

18
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:14,600
But many of those same media outlets were forced to walk back their reporting,

19
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,600
issuing updates like this one.

20
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:22,000
Israel cannot confirm the specific claim that babies were beheaded in Hamas attack.

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:26,700
Later that day, during a press conference, American President Joe Biden claimed

22
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:30,200
he had seen photographs of beheaded babies, saying,

23
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:39,700
I never really thought that I would see and have confirmed pictures of terrorists beheading children.

24
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:44,100
The White House later retracted the statement and published this correction.

25
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:51,000
U.S. officials and the president have not seen pictures nor confirmed such reports independently.

26
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,000
But the damage had been done.

27
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Biden's initial claims were already featured on the front pages of many news outlets

28
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:03,000
and continued to be cited in some quarters as justification for revenge attacks

29
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,600
and the collective punishment of civilians in Gaza.

30
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:12,200
Once these claims went viral, other journalists who were on the same visit to Kfar Azzah on the 10th of October say,

31
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:19,100
No one spoke to me about beheadings, let alone beheadings of children, let alone beheadings of 40 children.

32
00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:21,100
Another Israeli journalist said,

33
00:02:21,100 --> 00:02:24,100
During the tour, we didn't see any evidence of this,

34
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:29,800
and the army spokesperson or commanders also didn't mention any such incidents.

35
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:35,400
Sky News correspondent on the ground also confirms not being able to confirm these claims.

36
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:38,100
We have not seen the evidence of that.

37
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:42,900
We have asked the Israeli defense forces the IDF three times to confirm those numbers.

38
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:44,000
They have not yet.

39
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Later, the same journalist that broadcasted the claims of the spokesman of Israel's prime minister posted an apology,

40
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:57,900
saying the Israeli government now says today it cannot confirm babies were beheaded.

41
00:02:57,900 --> 00:03:01,900
I needed to be more careful with my words and I am sorry.

42
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:05,900
Hamas has denied claims that its fighters beheaded children, calling them lies.

43
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:09,900
As details continue to emerge from the aftermath of the Kfar Azzah attack,

44
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:13,200
the line between facts and misinformation has blurred.

45
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:21,200
Lies and half-truths have been disseminated by officials and mainstream media in what is becoming a propaganda war.

